OL,3,GNEWSAUp to 50 Scottish police officers
OL,4,Asuspended over alleged crimes against
OL,5,Awomen
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe added about 8,000 officers were
OL,8,Fstill to be "re-vetted" for their roles
OL,9,Fafter a change in regulations earlier
OL,10,Fthis year.
